What to do when starting a new version

- update parameters.dat
- update derived parameter section in "2_run_model_raven-bc-hydro.py"
- check if 2 years warm-up are ok


Running all basins

basins="Ash Alouette Arrow Brackendale_WSC Bridge Browns_River_WSC Cayoosh Cheakamus Clowhom Comox Coquitlam Duncan Jordan Kootenay_Lake La_Joie Libby Mica Revelstoke Salmo Seton Site_C Slocan Stave Strathcona Sugar Tsolum_River_WSC Wahleach Whatshan Williston"

for bb in ${basins} ; do ./__run_eee.sh -s Q -x 2_run_model_raven-bc-hydro.py -m parameters.dat -p ${bb} examples/bc-hydro/ ; done
